{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fate casts its dice\u2014and I see. I see that you'll take on the role of a girl. Hair like fire, born in a black hut near the graveyard. It's no easy role, and your choices are many: will you be kind and gentle, or wild and willful? Will you serve others, or seek only your own gain? Or maybe you\u2019ll walk a third path\u2026 Time will tell. Your fate is yours alone. It depends on you\u2014and your strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A text-based RPG set in a <strong>free-form Slavic fantasy world</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlimited freedom of choice</strong> \u2013 Every decision shapes the story, creating a unique experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> \u2013 Unlock different outcomes based on your actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An intriguing story</strong> \u2013 A tale that changes and deepens with each choice</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909690?t=1754935786","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909690?t=1754935786","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909690/2536ee510a90e253436440005d5c0dc4e323df64/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754935786","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909690/2536ee510a90e253436440005d5c0dc4e323df64/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754935786","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fate casts its dice\u2014and I see. I see that you'll take on the role of a girl. Hair like fire, born in a black hut near the graveyard. It's no easy r